                            <Polygon POINTS="428 2174 428 2185 2190 2193 2194 2174 2194 2144 2165 2133 2163 2133 2161 2133 2091 2143 2034 2133 2032 2133 1962 2143 1557 2133 1555 2133 1498 2143 1463 2133 1461 2133 1459 2133 1457 2133 1422 2143 1391 2133 1389 2133 1387 2133 1385 2133 1383 2133 1368 2144 1186 2144 1153 2133 1151 2133 1149 2133 1052 2143 954 2133 952 2133 951 2133 949 2133 935 2143 863 2133 861 2133 859 2133 857 2133 841 2144 707 2144 680 2133 678 2133 676 2133 674 2133 637 2143 590 2133 588 2133 477 2143 450 2133 448 2133 446 2133 444 2133 442 2133 428 2141 428 2174"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="from the house. Precisely such a case is described in a very popular tale,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l30" HPOS="436" VPOS="2189" WIDTH="918" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="438 2226 1354 2232" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="438 2226 436 2238 473 2254 475 2254 477 2256 551 2256 551 2254 553 2254 555 2254 555 2252 567 2242 576 2252 576 2254 578 2254 580 2254 756 2256 758 2256 760 2256 787 2242 873 2256 874 2256 876 2256 878 2256 894 2242 908 2252 910 2252 912 2252 913 2252 1015 2242 1027 2252 1028 2252 1030 2252 1032 2252 1087 2244 1097 2252 1097 2254 1099 2254 1101 2254 1180 2256 1182 2256 1352 2242 1354 2232 1352 2205 1169 2193 1167 2193 888 2201 873 2191 871 2191 869 2191 867 2191 808 2201 779 2191 777 2191 775 2191 773 2191 771 2191 771 2193 761 2201 730 2189 728 2189 726 2189 724 2189 699 2199 623 2189 621 2189 438 2197 438 2226"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="“The Bigamist.” It runs as follows: —"/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock ID="mz_3-067_r5" HPOS="427" VPOS="2270" WIDTH="1782" HEIGHT="460" TAGREFS="TYPE_2">
<Shape>
                        <Polygon POINTS="427 2270 2209 2270 2209 2730 427 2730"/>
                    </Shape>
                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l31" HPOS="545" VPOS="2289" WIDTH="1651" HEIGHT="48" BASELINE="545 2316 2196 2316" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="545 2316 545 2330 2194 2337 2196 2316 2196 2289 545 2289 545 2316"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="“There lived a man with two wives, an old one and a young one. When he took the young"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l32" HPOS="432" VPOS="2330" WIDTH="1764" HEIGHT="50" BASELINE="434 2363 2196 2357" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2363 434 2380 2194 2376 2196 2357 2190 2330 432 2335 434 2363"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="wife, he abandoned the old one, did not love her nor sleep with her any longer. He beat her all"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l33" HPOS="432" VPOS="2380" WIDTH="1764" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="434 2410 2196 2406" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2410 434 2425 2194 2423 2196 2406 2190 2380 432 2382 434 2410"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the time. In great grief she went out into the desert and came to a bear’s haunt. She entered."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l34" HPOS="432" VPOS="2421" WIDTH="1764" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="434 2458 2196 2452" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2458 434 2472 2194 2466 2196 2452 2190 2421 432 2427 434 2458"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The bear mother was angry at her for entering. The woman said, ‘Why don’t you kill me?"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l35" HPOS="430" VPOS="2466" WIDTH="1097" HEIGHT="53" BASELINE="432 2503 1527 2499" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="432 2503 432 2519 1525 2515 1527 2499 1522 2466 430 2476 432 2503"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="My husband always beats me. It is better that you kill me.’"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l36" HPOS="543" VPOS="2517" WIDTH="1657" HEIGHT="52" BASELINE="545 2544 2200 2548" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="545 2544 543 2558 576 2569 578 2569 580 2569 2198 2562 2200 2548 2198 2521 545 2517 545 2544"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="“The woman stays with the bears and lives with them. When spring comes, the bears let"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l37" HPOS="430" VPOS="2567" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="432 2599 2198 2593" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="432 2599 432 2612 2196 2608 2198 2593 2192 2567 430 2569 432 2599"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="her go, with presents and incantations. She returns home, and by means of their incantations"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l38" HPOS="432" VPOS="2612" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="434 2645 2198 2638" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2645 434 2661 2196 2655 2198 2638 2192 2612 432 2618 434 2645"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="succeeds in regaining the favor of her husband, and persuades him to drive her rival from the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l39" HPOS="432" VPOS="2653" WIDTH="918" HEIGHT="53" BASELINE="434 2692 1350 2688" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2692 434 2706 1348 2702 1350 2688 1346 2653 939 2653 937 2653 882 2663 440 2655 438 2655 436 2655 434 2655 434 2657 432 2657 434 2692"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="house. The latter perishes from hunger and cold.”"/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock ID="mz_3-067_r6" HPOS="427" VPOS="2730" WIDTH="1782" HEIGHT="311" TAGREFS="TYPE_3">
<Shape>
                        <Polygon POINTS="427 2730 2209 2730 2209 3041 427 3041"/>
                    </Shape>
                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l40" HPOS="539" VPOS="2739" WIDTH="1661" HEIGHT="54" BASELINE="541 2770 2200 2766" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="541 2770 541 2782 1013 2792 1015 2792 1064 2782 1075 2792 1077 2792 1079 2792 1081 2793 1184 2793 1184 2792 1264 2782 1286 2792 1288 2792 1290 2792 1292 2792 1323 2782 1911 2790 1913 2790 1915 2790 1944 2780 1958 2790 1960 2790 1962 2790 1964 2792 2110 2792 2110 2790 2112 2790 2141 2780 2178 2790 2180 2790 2182 2790 2184 2790 2186 2790 2200 2778 2200 2766 2196 2739 539 2739 541 2770"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="I took down several versions of this tale. I was always anxious to"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l41" HPOS="432" VPOS="2788" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="434 2832 2200 2827" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2832 434 2846 2198 2842 2200 2827 2196 2799 2124 2788 2122 2788 2075 2797 1761 2788 1759 2788 1757 2788 1755 2788 1740 2799 1605 2799 1120 2790 1118 2790 1116 2790 1073 2799 693 2792 691 2792 629 2801 588 2792 586 2792 584 2792 432 2803 434 2832"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="ascertain whether jealousy existed to any extent among the Chukchee wives"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l42" HPOS="432" VPOS="2848" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="66" BASELINE="434 2893 2200 2885" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2893 434 2905 637 2914 639 2914 2200 2901 2200 2885 2194 2850 1397 2858 1317 2848 1315 2848 1313 2848 1270 2860 1219 2850 1218 2850 1167 2860 567 2852 565 2852 563 2852 561 2852 547 2862 473 2852 471 2852 469 2852 432 2864 434 2893"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of a single husband. When questioned by me on that point, the women would"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l43" HPOS="434" VPOS="2906" WIDTH="1762" HEIGHT="69" BASELINE="436 2953 2196 2947" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="436 2953 436 2975 1089 2963 1588 2971 1590 2971 1592 2971 1611 2961 2192 2971 2196 2947 2194 2916 2171 2906 2169 2906 2167 2906 2093 2918 2063 2906 2061 2906 2059 2906 1985 2918 1927 2906 1925 2906 1923 2906 1898 2920 1835 2920 1785 2906 1783 2906 1781 2906 1779 2906 1746 2918 1648 2906 1646 2906 1644 2906 1605 2920 1582 2908 1580 2908 1578 2908 1463 2920 1446 2908 1444 2908 1442 2908 1440 2908 1438 2908 1399 2918 1366 2908 1364 2908 1362 2908 1360 2908 1358 2908 1338 2922 1118 2922 1097 2908 1095 2908 1093 2908 1091 2908 1089 2908 1052 2918 1025 2908 1023 2908 1021 2908 1019 2908 991 2922 878 2910 876 2910 874 2910 873 2910 855 2924 646 2924 586 2910 584 2910 434 2924 436 2953"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="generally answer, “We don’t care, we don’t think about those things;” and,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l44" HPOS="434" VPOS="2967" WIDTH="1756" HEIGHT="68" BASELINE="436 3010 2190 3004" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="436 3010 436 3023 783 3035 785 3035 787 3035 789 3035 804 3025 1001 3033 1003 3033 1403 3023 1568 3033 1570 3033 1572 3033 1617 3021 1668 3031 1670 3031 1761 3021 2151 3031 2153 3031 2155 3031 2190 3018 2190 3004 2184 2967 2124 2979 1981 2979 1958 2967 1956 2967 1954 2967 1952 2967 1950 2967 1935 2979 1541 2979 1504 2969 1502 2969 1500 2969 1161 2979 1104 2969 1103 2969 1101 2969 1079 2979 1048 2969 1046 2969 1044 2969 1042 2969 1007 2981 958 2971 956 2971 775 2981 750 2971 748 2971 588 2971 586 2971 584 2971 582 2971 567 2983 434 2983 436 3010"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="more definitely, “Good and clever women don’t get angry over such matters.”"/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock ID="mz_3-067_r7" HPOS="427" VPOS="3041" WIDTH="1782" HEIGHT="63" TAGREFS="TYPE_3">
<Shape>
                        <Polygon POINTS="427 3041 2209 3041 2209 3104 427 3104"/>
                    </Shape>
                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-067_l45" HPOS="543" VPOS="3027" WIDTH="1655" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="545 3072 2198 3064" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="545 3072 545 3088 2198 3084 2198 3064 2194 3037 1785 3027 1783 3027 1781 3027 1748 3039 543 3039 545 3072"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Nevertheless jealousy does exist among the women. I have often known"/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
